{"script":"s_4_9_2","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show]奇怪的东西？这里有很多灵魂徘徊，天天都能遇到奇怪的东西……你是指什么？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"类似火光的异象？","tag":"tag_3"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show][cm]火光？这倒是很稀奇。不过昨天我好像确实看见了类似的情况。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show]我昨日在值守时，看见有火光从禁林的北边蹿了过去。你们说的应该是这个吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没错！和那群蕈人看到的一模一样！这种现象难道不奇怪吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show]阴魂禁林附近有很多灵魂和魔物徘徊，像这种奇怪的事情经常会发生。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show]半夜听到喧闹和光照都是很正常的事情……就算是亮光，也可能是提灯妖精吧。无需担忧，那些家伙根本兴不起什么风浪。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这个……虽然你可能觉得很正常，但那光很有可能是火。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（告知蕈人庄园遇到的情况。）","tag":"tag_11"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show][cm]什么？那玩意是火？这下可不能放任它了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女伊尔萨","text":"[show]从方向上来看，它应该往巨木那边去了！得赶快过去看看！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我们来这里就是为